  {
   "text": "you answer at two in the morning.",
   "start": 8.709,
   "end": 10.242,
   "e": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "And some of them",
   "start": 10.432,
   "end": 11.419,
   "e": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "will expect it.",
   "start": 11.457,
   "end": 12.524,
   "e": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead,",
   "start": 13.006,
   "end": 13.587,
   "e": 0.55
  },
  {
   "text": "write it in your notes.",
   "start": 13.666,
   "end": 14.723,
   "e": 0.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Draft it at night.",
   "start": 14.883,
   "end": 15.911,
   "e": 0.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Send it at seven fifty,",
   "start": 16.049,
   "end": 17.419,
   "e": 0.65
  },
  {
   "text": "before your first client.",
   "start": 17.51,
   "end": 18.836,
   "e": 0.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Same reply.",
   "start": 19.247,
   "end": 20.147,
   "e": 0.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Better words.",
   "start": 20.276,
   "end": 21.111,
   "e": 0.75
  },
  {
   "text": "And they learn when you answer,",
